{
    "title": "Everskies: Virtual Dress up",
    "description": "Welcome to the Everskies mobile game. It is an avatar maker and life simulator game that combines the dress up concept, where you can create your own character to match different clothes, hairstyles, shoes, and much more. You can also meet new friends, chat with people, and design your avatar fashion style as you want. Your second life with the virtual world is in Everskies! Join it, dress up, and become a virtual creator!\r\n\r\nEverskies is more than a real-life simulator. It is an online character creator where you can dress up your avatar with different fashion outfits, shoes, and hairstyles. You can also have different styles of chat rooms. Make your own avatar character within the metaverse world, meet new people, chat with friends, customize your animated emoji, select the outfit, and send messages in chat rooms! The dream life is waiting for you in this role-playing game.\r\n\r\n[\ud83d\udc69 MAKE YOUR OWN AVATAR \ud83e\uddd1]\r\nCreate your own avatar in this life simulator and experience a real character rather than a cartoon character! Moreover, customize your avatar\u2019s looks with thousands of options for make-up, outfits, and facial features for you to meet new friends and have fun in this virtual dress up game.\r\n\r\n[\ud83d\udc57 DRESS UP YOUR VIRTUAL AVATAR CHARACTER \ud83d\udc57]\r\nBe a virtual stylist in this life simulator! Dress up your avatar with your fashion style and you'll decide how your character looks with over 150,000 items to choose from. Start to match your characters with a variety of different styles to play freely regardless of whether you like lazy style, y2k, anime style, teen, Lolita, or another style. You can play with your creativity in this dress up simulation game! Your avatar dress style will be an important part of your metaverse identity.\r\n\r\n[\ud83c\udfa8 CREATE YOUR OWN FASHION ITEMS \ud83c\udfa8]\r\nCreate virtual items to be worn, collected, and traded by thousands in our social community - design goods such as outfits, clothes, and your DIY items can also be sold in stores. Become a creative designer in this virtual world game!\r\n\r\n[\ud83d\udcac FIND PEOPLE WITH SIMILAR INTERESTS & MEET NEW FRIENDS \ud83d\udcac ]\r\nOur clubs, forums, chat rooms, and group messages help you to find your people regardless of how niche your hobby is. In Everskies, you can join the family that you are interested in, meet friends from near or far, and chat with people from all over the world! Enjoy a virtual world, make new friends, and play the role that you want in your virtual life!\r\n\r\n[\ud83d\udcb0 EARN A VIRTUAL FORTUNE \ud83d\udcb0]\r\nDo you have a hidden business expert in you? Buy, sell, and trade fashion items to climb to the top! Your second life with the virtual world is in the Everskies metaverse!\r\nWhether you're a collector or trader, the thriving Everskies economy offers you plenty of opportunities to capitalize on the potential of a large creator community. \r\n\r\nEverskies is a fun dress up game that is simple to play. As a gem among virtual games with a lot of special effects, outfits, stickers, and a huge number of scenes, it brings you a variety of ways to play. Feel free to be creative and dress up the character in this simulator game!\r\n\r\nEverskies has a chat room, private chat, and group chat system. The game also has trading, competitions, clubs, games, and much more that are worth your time to explore! Join our online sim virtual world and create your second life!\r\n\r\nFollow us on Instagram @everskies for regular giveaways!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Everskies mobile game. It is an avatar maker and life simulator game that combines the dress up concept, where you can create your own character to match different clothes, hairstyles, shoes, and much more. You can also meet new friends, chat with people, and design your avatar fashion style as you want. Your second life with the virtual world is in Everskies! Join it, dress up, and become a virtual creator!<br><br>Everskies is more than a real-life simulator. It is an online character creator where you can dress up your avatar with different fashion outfits, shoes, and hairstyles. You can also have different styles of chat rooms. Make your own avatar character within the metaverse world, meet new people, chat with friends, customize your animated emoji, select the outfit, and send messages in chat rooms! The dream life is waiting for you in this role-playing game.<br><br>[\ud83d\udc69 MAKE YOUR OWN AVATAR \ud83e\uddd1]<br>Create your own avatar in this life simulator and experience a real character rather than a cartoon character! Moreover, customize your avatar\u2019s looks with thousands of options for make-up, outfits, and facial features for you to meet new friends and have fun in this virtual dress up game.<br><br>[\ud83d\udc57 DRESS UP YOUR VIRTUAL AVATAR CHARACTER \ud83d\udc57]<br>Be a virtual stylist in this life simulator! Dress up your avatar with your fashion style and you&#39;ll decide how your character looks with over 150,000 items to choose from. Start to match your characters with a variety of different styles to play freely regardless of whether you like lazy style, y2k, anime style, teen, Lolita, or another style. You can play with your creativity in this dress up simulation game! Your avatar dress style will be an important part of your metaverse identity.<br><br>[\ud83c\udfa8 CREATE YOUR OWN FASHION ITEMS \ud83c\udfa8]<br>Create virtual items to be worn, collected, and traded by thousands in our social community - design goods such as outfits, clothes, and your DIY items can also be sold in stores. Become a creative designer in this virtual world game!<br><br>[\ud83d\udcac FIND PEOPLE WITH SIMILAR INTERESTS &amp; MEET NEW FRIENDS \ud83d\udcac ]<br>Our clubs, forums, chat rooms, and group messages help you to find your people regardless of how niche your hobby is. In Everskies, you can join the family that you are interested in, meet friends from near or far, and chat with people from all over the world! Enjoy a virtual world, make new friends, and play the role that you want in your virtual life!<br><br>[\ud83d\udcb0 EARN A VIRTUAL FORTUNE \ud83d\udcb0]<br>Do you have a hidden business expert in you? Buy, sell, and trade fashion items to climb to the top! Your second life with the virtual world is in the Everskies metaverse!<br>Whether you&#39;re a collector or trader, the thriving Everskies economy offers you plenty of opportunities to capitalize on the potential of a large creator community. <br><br>Everskies is a fun dress up game that is simple to play. As a gem among virtual games with a lot of special effects, outfits, stickers, and a huge number of scenes, it brings you a variety of ways to play. Feel free to be creative and dress up the character in this simulator game!<br><br>Everskies has a chat room, private chat, and group chat system. The game also has trading, competitions, clubs, games, and much more that are worth your time to explore! Join our online sim virtual world and create your second life!<br><br>Follow us on Instagram @everskies for regular giveaways!",
